WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.445 --> 00:00:05.194
Unit seventeen. Understanding App Permissions!

2
00:00:06.104 --> 00:00:11.444
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:11.494 --> 00:00:14.826
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.876 --> 00:00:19.884
Today we learn about Understanding App Permissions. Let's go!

5
00:00:21.232 --> 00:00:25.198
Permission. Say it with me. Permission!

6
00:00:28.739 --> 00:00:32.739
Access. Say it with me. Access!

7
00:00:36.230 --> 00:00:40.850
Camera permission. Say it with me. Camera permission!

8
00:00:44.353 --> 00:00:49.705
Location permission. Say it with me. Location permission!

9
00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:56.736
Grant. Say it with me. Grant!

10
00:01:00.203 --> 00:01:03.937
Deny. Say it with me. Deny!

11
00:01:07.406 --> 00:01:12.106
Privacy setting. Say it with me. Privacy setting!

12
00:01:15.606 --> 00:01:19.556
Request. Say it with me. Request!

13
00:01:23.061 --> 00:01:33.723
An app permission is a request for access, like a camera permission or location permission. I can grant or deny each request to protect my privacy setting.

14
00:01:33.773 --> 00:01:37.038
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:37.748 --> 00:01:43.247
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:43.297 --> 00:01:44.896
Camera permission!

17
00:01:45.715 --> 00:01:51.144
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:51.194 --> 00:01:52.708
Privacy setting!

19
00:01:53.636 --> 00:02:01.262
Did you know? Being thoughtful about app permissions is one of the best ways to protect your personal privacy on a device!

20
00:02:01.312 --> 00:02:03.475
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:04.627 --> 00:02:14.435
Think and answer. Why might you deny an app's request for a permission it doesn't really need?

22
00:02:14.485 --> 00:02:15.635
Great answer!

23
00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:22.300
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:25.599
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

